# Development
For the sake of sanity, use an emulator instead of testing on live PS3 hardware. Not only is there a chance to brick your console, but also it takes FOREVER to download and reinstall the game and DLC should it be messed up. Start by downloading an emulator: `https://rpcs3.net/download`, install RB3 and at least one DLC pack.

